                            "spans": [
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "content": "Although the Dispatch API provides functions for parsing and accessing the dispatch result, you may want to handle the response yourself. In that case, this description of the returned dispatch list may be helpful.​Pre-defined headers for the dispatch list"
